ithub.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/2e5d8245c6c5256cb0e399f3fc1e05d1463c5198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:15:52Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:15:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Give Matsapha Data Export the General role baseline (#470)\n\nMatsapha: Data Export is the only role in roles_matsapha.csv with an\nempty Inherited roles column, so a user holding just that role has none\nof the distro''s baseline API privileges. Hitting anything the O3 apps\nread on load fails, for instance\n\n  /ws/rest/v1/personattributetype/{uuid}\n  403 User is logged in but doesn''t have the relevant privilege\n      [Privileges required: Get Person Attribute Types]\n\nwhich the patient search app calls once per entry in the 13-item\npersonAttributes filter list in msf-matsapha-frontend-config.json.\n\nGeneral role is the only place Get Person Attribute Types and View\nPerson Attribute Types are granted, and nothing grants privileges to\nthe implicit Authenticated role, so there is no fallback. a21b0451 added\nthe report privileges to this role but left inheritance blank, and the\nrole has apparently only ever been handed out alongside another role,\nwhich is what hid it.\n\nInherit General role, matching the other two Matsapha roles. Both\nalready reference distro_roles.csv across files at the same _order:1000\n- Clinical inherits General Doctor, Registration Supervisor inherits\nPatient registration - so the cross-file resolution here is the path\nalready proven in production, not a new ordering assumption.\n\nNote the widened surface: General role is described as read-only but\ncarries 15 mutating privileges out of 61, among them Add/Edit Patients,\nAdd/Edit Visits, Add/Edit Encounters, Add/Edit Observations and Edit\nUsers. Report users can now write patient data through the API. The\nnarrower alternative is to grant only the two person-attribute-type\nprivileges, but that becomes an allowlist to extend every time another\napp reads something on load, and it would leave Data Export the one\nrole that does not sit on the shared baseline.\n\nUnrelated to the 401 seen on the same endpoint on UAT: that one reports\n\"User is not logged in\", which BaseRestController only returns when\nContext.isAuthenticated() is false, so it is a session or response\ncaching question rather than a privilege one. The bracketed privilege\nname in both bodies is just the tail of the underlying\nAPIAuthenticationException and does not distinguish them.","tree":{"sha":"6171deba8716d0a3a036c4911f513a4e9add9ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/6171deba8716d0a3a036c4911f513a4e9add9ebf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/2e5d8245c6c5256cb0e399f3fc1e05d1463c5198","verification":{"payload":"tree 6171deba8716d0a3a036c4911f513a4e9add9ebf\nparent 6408bc19805aa22f940a8198a929d3a6f87f365d\nauthor Pius Rubangakene <piruville@gmail.com> 1789917352 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789917352 -0700\n\n(fix) Give Matsapha Data Export the General role baseline (#470)\n\nMatsapha: Data Export is the only role in roles_matsapha.csv with an\nempty Inherited roles column, so a user holding just that role has none\nof the distro''s baseline API privileges. Hitting anything the O3 apps\nread on load fails, for instance\n\n  /ws/rest/v1/personattributetype/{uuid}\n  403 User is logged in but doesn''t have the relevant privilege\n      [Privileges required: Get Person Attribute Types]\n\nwhich the patient search app calls once per entry in the 13-item\npersonAttributes filter list in msf-matsapha-frontend-config.json.\n\nGeneral role is the only place Get Person Attribute Types and View\nPerson Attribute Types are granted, and nothing grants privileges to\nthe implicit Authenticated role, so there is no fallback. a21b0451 added\nthe report privileges to this role but left inheritance blank, and the\nrole has apparently only ever been handed out alongside another role,\nwhich is what hid it.\n\nInherit General role, matching the other two Matsapha roles. Both\nalready reference distro_roles.csv across files at the same _order:1000\n- Clinical inherits General Doctor, Registration Supervisor inherits\nPatient registration - so the cross-file resolution here is the path\nalready proven in production, not a new ordering assumption.\n\nNote the widened surface: General role is described as read-only but\ncarries 15 mutating privileges out of 61, among them Add/Edit Patients,\nAdd/Edit Visits, Add/Edit Encounters, Add/Edit Observations and Edit\nUsers. Report users can now write patient data through the API. The\nnarrower alternative is to grant only the two person-attribute-type\nprivileges, but that becomes an allowlist to extend every time another\napp reads something on load, and it would leave Data Export the one\nrole that does not sit on the shared baseline.\n\nUnrelated to the 401 seen on the same endpoint on UAT: that one reports\n\"User is not logged in\", which BaseRestController only returns when\nContext.isAuthenticated() is false, so it is a session or response\ncaching question rather than a privilege one. The bracketed privilege\nname in both bodies is just the tail of the underlying\nAPIAuthenticationException and does not distinguish them.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqr/ioCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2Q0QAEztwxoL925bCOQo/TtkP0bM\nV3c+Gh85Ugf0ji1NzQImdmUXy0D1c5aRVOeuDf86jE/EOG3jLLMHP9qRyt0mhTLC\n9k2RD2Yes7KcIHVGUvHMEc2jtbShMHH/kLYdagHR4eCl3dIPYXgipV2GbJLju+di\nMkD3i9dFFsC5Dk23O34Sw4M1b0FE3yttuRkdGPpCp9dOkSttQOGtJ5ATVD6RJ6NI\nvaRJfjwwm3EhF61GkOvsp0c804MHnW6mh8/wM/jK/sMqOctgHbHcZ0KsPwFakVx9\n2mL2q0EtquAS73LCl+9ZV25+CSjnmIkaPPTpA9Ns/jHIfWSd6KYPAgGhBV/bFdgE\nMpW0uRP6HLKYyOaeNCU8sJVLzKcda88eW0fqH/WZs1MJKORixWxqCPNd7mWMXyzz\ncS1GoAP2Hj+egSGZDlHnIaKUFbsCab4vRxFLIwSlEvMwBheqkhRH8MLikE2cH2Le\n77dNKznLK1Gq1/XqcPQBdm4vtCO/p6bBdbp6JbOiYFfuSZb2MPzv4bA+Xn/qCSFY\ntdkQCvHNOZyb2VBkh7Z0F8azp+kQGGliKn4RcY4ZBROc5bIMk0tVSM2veYGLW9+O\nCf61jJTSQnHwRcS5fsxbgqEW0YhHKPyZ8W71Gk2SN2MdzQpPwln507DhBPbjeyWe\nB79UO8QnftruxuZJAEL9\n=ZQiX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T15:15:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/2e5d8245c6c5256cb0e399f3fc1e05d1463c51