ub.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/257bd604ad910f3a0efcee3346928ae77a1fb15b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:14:11Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:14:11Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"(fix) Remove auto-close visits scheduler changesets from site liquibase\n\nThe AutoCloseVisitsTask row was inserted directly into\nscheduler_task_config by a per-site changeset in bunia, matsapha and\nmosul. All three guard on the same task UUID, so the duplication served\nno purpose beyond drift between sites.\n\nIn mosul the changeset was also mis-identified as\n\"unvoid_arabic_translations-202411271458\" while carrying the auto-close\nSQL, which made the site history misleading.\n\nExisting deployments are unaffected - the changesets have already run\nand the scheduler row persists. The visits.autoCloseVisitType global\nproperty stays under initializer_config/globalproperties.","tree":{"sha":"f9d50fd498763677f25e7588ab4fc1803679c130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/f9d50fd498763677f25e7588ab4fc1803679c130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/257bd604ad910f3a0efcee3346928ae77a1fb15b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","foll