,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/cc2e2710fd0d7786badc1ae8ad84e941fc1e065f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:02:05Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:02:05Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"Tag Visit Location on locations missing it (empty Visit location dropdown)\n\nesm-active-patient-visits filters its \"Visit location\" dropdown by the\nVisit Location tag. mosul_locations.csv, matsapha_locations.csv, and\nthe base distro_locations.csv demo template never included this tag\nin their history, unlike bunia_locations.csv''s top-level location -\nso the dropdown was empty on every site except Bunia.\n\n- mosul: tag Mental Health (MH)\n- matsapha: tag Manzini Clinic (only location)\n- distro (demo template): tag Demo Clinic (only location), so new\n  sites built off this template don''t inherit the same gap","tree":{"sha":"b7e80e9eb3a819ff73584161769088f3b72d3d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/b7e80e9eb3a819ff73584161769088f3b72d3d9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/cc2e2710fd0d7786badc1ae8ad84e941fc1e065f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/cc2e2710fd0d7786badc1ae8ad84e941fc1e065f","node_id":"C_kwDOLPFUQdoAKGNjMmUyNzEwZmQwZDc3ODZiYWRjMWFlOGFkODRlOTQxZmMxZTA2NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc","sha":"82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc"}],"sha":"cc2e2710fd0d7786badc1ae8ad84e941fc1e065f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/cc2e2710fd0d7786badc1ae8ad84e941fc1e065f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:01:29Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:01:29Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"Deploy the actual serialization.xstream module, not just its API jar\n\ndistro/pom.xml only ever declared serialization.xstream-api (a\ncompile-time dependency other modules link against), never\nserialization.xstream-omod (the deployable module). The real installed\nmodule was whatever the base Ozone distro bundled by default (0.2.16),\ncompletely untouched by the serialization-xstream.version property -\na pre-existing gap that only started mattering once reporting 2.1.0\nraised its own floor to >=0.3.0, cascading into reporting/reportingrest/\npatientdocuments/patientsummary all failing to start.\n\nAlso adds the OpenMRS repository directly to the project pom: the\nartifact resolves from mavenrepo.openmrs.org but not from Mekom''s\nmks-nexus-public mirror, and relying on a developer''s personal\nsettings.xml for this is fragile (breaks in CI or on other machines).\nThe dependency also needs an explicit <type>omod</type> since this\nartifact is published with omod packaging rather than the jar default.","tree":{"sha":"c1d80323a31ace319bba6546b4462eb6295567c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/c1d80323a31ace319bba6546b4462eb6295567c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc","node_id":"C_kwDOLPFUQdoAKDgyNTMzZWQ1Y2FjNDM3NThlNGVlMjljOTFkMDJiYmU5NzQwZjI4ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f","sha":"a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f"}],"sha":"82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/82533ed5cac43758e4ee29c91d02bbe9740f28dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:01:13Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:01:13Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"Bump 21 module versions for OpenMRS 2.8.7 compatibility\n\nFull audit of every pinned module''s require_version against platform\n2.8.7 (parallel research + cross-checked against dev3.openmrs.org,\nOpenMRS''s own reference instance confirmed running on 2.8.7) found\nthese versions were stale relative to the new platform floor:\n\n- legacyui 1.23.0 -> 2.1.0\n- reporting 1.28.0 -> 2.1.0 (fixes CGLIB proxy crash on SerializedDefinitionServiceImpl)\n- stockmanagement 2.0.3 -> 3.0.0 (fixes CGLIB proxy crash on StockManagementDao, Hibernate Search 6 migration)\n- serialization-xstream 0.2.16 -> 0.3.0\n- authentication 2.0.0 -> 2.3.0\n- fhir2 2.7.0 -> 4.1.0\n- calculation 1.3.0 -> 2.0.0\n- htmlwidgets 1.11.0 -> 2.0.1\n- event 3.0.0 -> 4.0.0\n- metadatamapping 1.6.0 -> 2.0.0\n- queue 2.9.0 -> 3.0.0\n- reportingrest 1.15.0 -> 2.0.0\n- bedmanagement 6.2.0-SNAPSHOT -> 7.2.0\n- attachments 3.7.0 -> 4.0.0\n- initializer 2.12.0-SNAPSHOT -> 2.12.0 (released)\n- openconceptlab 2.4.0 -> 3.1.0\n- patientflags 3.0.10-SNAPSHOT -> 3.0.10 (real tag)\n- billing 1.3.2 -> 2.3.0\n- idgen 4.14.0 -> 5.0.4\n- teleconsultation 2.1.0-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.0 (real tag; snapshot was ahead of any released build)\n- ordertemplates 1.0.2 -> 2.2.0\n\nLeft unresolved: patientsummary, fhirproxy, and drools have no\ncompatibility signal either way (not part of the reference app dev3\nruns) and need empirical testing.","tree":{"sha":"264d4d29002cb4d2cb15ba6bef24d3780abd46eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/264d4d29002cb4d2cb15ba6bef24d3780abd46eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f","node_id":"C_kwDOLPFUQdoAKGEyNTFjMGE1NjNjM2ZhOTQ2NDdmZDE4ZmVlNmQyOGE2MGMyZWE3OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd","sha":"75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd"}],"sha":"a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/a251c0a563c3fa94647fd18fee6d28a60c2ea78f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:50Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:50Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"Upgrade lime-emr module to 1.1.0\n\nThe custom lime-emr module (MadiroGlobalHealth/openmrs-module-lime)\nhard-required datafilter>=2.2.0 in its config.xml and directly\nimplemented datafilter''s listener interfaces, so removing datafilter\nbroke lime-emr''s own startup and cascaded into a broad Spring context\nfailure. 1.1.0 drops that dependency.","tree":{"sha":"493874f8496c8b0b07dbe23dba11993a2a7732ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/493874f8496c8b0b07dbe23dba11993a2a7732ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd","node_id":"C_kwDOLPFUQdoAKDc1YTYyNDZmMmJhNDUyOWRjYjQ0Y2JiYzQ5MDU4N2U0NTljNzc5ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commit/626c94d34a402929fe52342f12d259e99710dc3b","sha":"626c94d34a402929fe52342f12d259e99710dc3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/626c94d34a402929fe52342f12d259e99710dc3b"}],"sha":"75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/75a6246f2ba4529dcb44cbbc490587e459c779fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pirupius","id":15266028,"login":"pirupius","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjY2MDI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/commits/626c94d34a402929fe52342f12d259e99710dc3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:41Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:41Z","email":"piruville@gmail.com","name":"Pius Rubangakene"},"message":"Upgrade OpenMRS platform to 2.8.7\n\nemrapi 3.4.0 and tasks 2.1.0 both declare require_version 2.8.0 in their\nconfig.xml, but the distro was pinned to platform 2.7.7 - so neither\nmodule was registering on Manage Modules, silently breaking the Task\nList feature. Bumps the platform property and the docker-compose image\ntag to 2.8.7, matching webservices.rest 3.5.0''s own floor (2.8.7),\nwhich is the highest requirement among the recently-bumped modules.","tree":{"sha":"ebe8d282f17e15a95b2a9a430857ba8381fcd2e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/trees/ebe8d282f17e15a95b2a9a430857ba8381fcd2e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MSF-OCG/LIME-EMR/git/commits/626c94d34a402929fe52342f12d259e99710dc3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15266028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirupius/followers","follo