,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/2446711897644d296c05a7a6106821315e411f77"}],"sha":"12a0ef6ccbd0fc24b54f78abb4ac881cb542cf8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/12a0ef6ccbd0fc24b54f78abb4ac881cb542cf8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85610882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lkladnit","id":85610882,"login":"lkladnit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjEwODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/aa648e1dbb46b965cc986f3e89ed796fe82cfac6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:21:21Z","email":"lkladnit@redhat.com","name":"Leon Kladnitsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:00:30Z","email":"lkladnit@redhat.com","name":"Leon Kladnitsky"},"message":"OCPNETUI-56: Add hot-cluster E2E workflows, composite actions, and Dockerfile.ci\n\nAdd GitHub Actions infrastructure for running Cypress E2E tests on a\npersistent (hot) OpenShift cluster via ARC self-hosted runners:\n\nWorkflows:\n- hot-cluster-e2e.yml: entry point with PR gating (fork trust via\n  author_association or ok-to-test label), cluster health check\n- hot-cluster-e2e-run.yml: build plugin image to ttl.sh, provision\n  test environment via ci-env-controller, run Cypress, collect\n  diagnostics, tear down\n\nComposite actions:\n- ci-env-request: create trigger ConfigMap, wait for environment ready\n- ci-env-release: signal teardown, wait for cleanup, delete ConfigMap\n\nDocker:\n- Dockerfile.ci: multi-stage build using public UBI9 base images\n  (not registry.ci.openshift.org which requires Prow auth)\n- .dockerignore: exclude CI/test files from image builds\n\nFIPS cluster support:\n- OPENSSL_FORCE_FIPS_MODE=0 and GOLANG_FIPS=0 for runner and oc CLI\n- KUBECONFIG set to writable path for non-root runners\n- oc CLI downloaded to RUNNER_TEMP on each job\n\nAddress PR #497 review feedback\n- Move concurrency block from hot-cluster-e2e.yml to run-e2e-tests job in hot-cluster-e2e-run.yml\n- Remove oc login step and rely on mounted ServiceAccount token for cluster authentication\n- Delete trigger-hot-cluster.sh script (no longer needed with workflow_dispatch only)\n- Add comprehensive CLUSTER.md documentation for RHOS cluster preparation with mounted tokens\n- Simplify authentication by using in-pod KUBECONFIG from projected ServiceAccount volumes\n\nAdd branch input to hot-cluster E2E workflows\n- Add optional ''branch'' input parameter to hot-cluster-e2e.yml (defaults to current branch)\n- Add ''branch'' input to workflow_call in hot-cluster-e2e-run.yml for reusability\n- Update both checkout steps to use inputs.branch with fallback to github.ref\n- Allows users to test specific branches via workflow_dispatch UI\n- Enables external workflows to specify which branch to test against\n\nImplement in-pod ServiceAccount token authentication\n- Add kubeconfig generation from mounted ServiceAccount token for both check-runner and run-e2e-tests jobs\n- Automatically detect and use /var/run/secrets/kubernetes.io/serviceaccount/token\n- Generate kubeconfig referencing mounted CA certificate\n- Support optional CLUSTER_API env var for custom cluster endpoints (defaults to kubernetes.default.svc)\n- Add error handling in run-e2e-tests (required) vs warning in check-runner (optional for GitHub-hosted runners)\n- Verify cluster connectivity with oc cluster-info after kubeconfig setup\n- Update CLUSTER.md documentation to reflect automatic kubeconfig generation\n- Eliminates need for CLUSTER_TOKEN secret for authentication\n\nFix ci/prow/lint timeout\n- Remove accidentally committed ui-tests-cy/ci-hot-cluster-e2e/ CI artifacts\n  (screenshots, app.js, HTML reports) that caused eslint to hang for 2h\n- Ignore ui-tests-cy/ci-hot-cluster-e2e/ and gui-test-screenshots in\n  .gitignore and .eslintignore\n\nDepends on ci-scripts (#489), ci-test-stack (#490), ci-env-controller (#491).\n\nJira: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/OCPNETUI-56\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"49d2ac8437f160a7f208e7361b4a2cbe03859705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/trees/49d2ac8437f160a7f208e7361b4a2cbe03859705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/commits/aa648e1dbb46b965cc986f3e89ed796fe82cfac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85610882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lkladnit","id":85610882,"login":"lkladnit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjEwODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commit/aa648e1dbb46b965cc986f3e89ed796fe82cfac6","node_id":"C_kwDOLTB3JNoAKGFhNjQ4ZTFkYmI0NmI5NjVjYzk4NmYzZTg5ZWQ3OTZmZTgyY2ZhYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commit/5955f55e59bdda379b9199b3efe4bf6a351cb469","sha":"5955f55e59bdda379b9199b3efe4bf6a351cb469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/5955f55e59bdda379b9199b3efe4bf6a351cb469"}],"sha":"aa648e1dbb46b965cc986f3e89ed796fe82cfac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/aa648e1dbb46b965cc986f3e89ed796fe82cfac6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108997439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Parthivk100","id":108997439,"login":"Parthivk100","node_id":"U_kgDOBn8rPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parthivk100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/2446711897644d296c05a7a6106821315e411f77/comments","comm