er":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:25:36Z","email":"lkladnit@redhat.com","name":"Leon Kladnitsky"},"message":"OCPNETUI-56: Add ci-env-controller Helm chart for test environment lifecycle\n\nAdd Helm chart for a controller that watches trigger ConfigMaps and\nmanages test environment lifecycle via the ci-test-stack chart:\n\nController:\n- Bash-based reconciliation loop watching ConfigMaps with label\n  ci.networking-console-plugin/type=test-environment\n- Provisions environments: resolves console image from cluster OCP\n  version, helm installs ci-test-stack into per-run namespace\n- Tears down environments: helm uninstalls, deletes namespace\n- Auto-reaps stale environments older than configurable TTL\n\nRBAC:\n- ClusterRole for console SA (read networking CRDs: NADs, UDNs,\n  policies, routes, NNCPs, plus console/config resources)\n- ClusterRole for controller (superset: namespace/deployment CRUD)\n- ClusterRole for test runner (CRUD on networking test resources)\n- Namespaced Role for trigger ConfigMap management\n\nDepends on:\n- ci-scripts (#489)\n- ci-test-stack chart (#490)\n\nJira: OCPNETUI-56\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3fe05d97d456dd0b42932800e32569335ce85fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/trees/a3fe05d97d456dd0b42932800e32569335ce85fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/commits/859f01f8e521fbbe50481ff956f165578c97f573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85610882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lkladnit","id