026-09-08T15:59:33Z","email":"lkladnit@redhat.com","name":"Leon Kladnitsky"},"message":"OCPNETUI-22: Add Cypress E2E tests for Service create and edit form\n\nCover ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer, and ExternalName workflows, plus\nvalidation, form/YAML sync, edit, and delete. Add data-test attributes so\nselectors stay stable in CI.\n\nUse the core~v1~Service path for details navigation and skip a redundant reload when already on the page. Reorder the ConsoleWindow intersection so perfectionist lint passes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cf37454ca6a17567065c2f0ef89fcbfe4e4c057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/trees/4cf37454ca6a17567065c2f0ef89fcbfe4e4c057"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/git/commits/86811de58bac0fd168f4f8fef3071dbb2ff808a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85610882?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lkladnit","id":85610882,"login":"lkladnit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjEwODgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lkladnit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commit/86811de58bac0fd168f4f8fef3071dbb2ff808a9","node_id":"C_kwDOLTB3JNoAKDg2ODExZGU1OGJhYzBmZDE2OGY0ZjhmZWYzMDcxZGJiMmZmODA4YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commit/fff554190d7ecf29bdacc01f3331af1f54cbad51","sha":"fff554190d7ecf29bdacc01f3331af1f54cbad51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/fff554190d7ecf29bdacc01f3331af1f54cbad51"}],"sha":"86811de58bac0fd168f4f8fef3071dbb2ff808a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/86811de58bac0fd168f4f8fef3071dbb2ff808a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64194103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rszwajko","id":64194103,"login":"rszwajko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTk0MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rszwajko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/networking-console-plugin/commits/7a0f5bbd7b74e5e119354c2978615855b5e4c22f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:14:17Z","email":"rszwajko@redhat.com","name":"Radoslaw Szwajkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T11:11:20Z","email":"rszwajko@redhat.com","name":"Radoslaw Szwajkowski"},"message":"Add multi-branch dependabot config\n\nFor main branch:\n1. in npm package system aggregate all updates in one PR (per branch).\n   Include only minor and patch updates (both version and security).\n2. in github actions package system aggregate all updates in one PR.\n   Include all version updates (including major). Only main branch is\n   supported as older branches have no github actions.\n3. ignore shared modules provided (currently) by Console. Unused modules\n   are ignored.\n\nFor release branches:\n1. update not only patch but also minor versions - reasoning is that:\n   a) usually the latest minor version is the only version\n      that receives security updates\n   b) minor version should not contain breaking changes\n2. ignore list is limited to dynamic SDK packages which is only a subset\n   of all shared modules. The remaining packages follow the regular\n   dependency update process - reasoning is that:\n   a) production code is unchanged and minor and patch versions should\n      be backwards compatible\n   b) the Console is updating their deps in parallel so an up-to-date\n      cluster may be close to our versions\n   c) shorter ignore list is more readable - note that dependabot\n      does not support yml aliases (yet)\n   d) the shared modules list changed in time and would require\n      different ignore lists per branch\n\nNote:\n1. dependabot provides security updates only on default branch, however\n   patch updates should address most of the security issues.\n2. dependency-type \"all\" covers also transitive dependencies although\n   the docs do not list npm as supported package manager\n3. updates for release branches use custom commit message prefix\n\nReference-Url: https://github.com/openshift/console/blob/c46e0aabe4c9cf330f1e56ad323076e7e8e7f7d8/frontend/packages/console-dynamic-plugin-sdk/src/shared-modules/shared-modules-meta.ts#L41\nReference-Url: https://github.com/dependabot/dependabot-core/issues/1582\nSigned-off-by: Radoslaw Szwajkowski <rszwajko@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"420d65e1d3995fd8ebc41d9d9519