1a69f45f2ad7774fca115cf6f53adc3598c4778","node_id":"C_kwDOLVmnatoAKDExYTY5ZjQ1ZjJhZDc3NzRmY2ExMTVjZjZmNTNhZGMzNTk4YzQ3Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0e","sha":"ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6","sha":"41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6"}],"sha":"11a69f45f2ad7774fca115cf6f53adc3598c4778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/11a69f45f2ad7774fca115cf6f53adc3598c4778"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:46:18Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:46:18Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"message":"fix e2e guided tour modal race condition on OCP 4.19\n\nguidedTour.close() used two independent if blocks that both matched\nthe modal on OCP 4.19, which has both the guided-tour-modal data-test\nattribute and the pf-v5-c-modal-box class. Since cy commands queued\ninside .then() run after all synchronous checks, both blocks queued a\nclick, the second targeting a button on an already-dismissed modal and\ntiming out after 40s. Changing the second if to else if ensures only\none handler runs per modal.\n\nSuggested by the OCP CI QE Agent analysis on PR #310''s failed e2e run;\nverified there with a passing rerun on OCP 4.19.47.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d847fc30f5029277053e3e12de42945a881fb9ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/trees/d847fc30f5029277053e3e12de42945a881fb9ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/commits/41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6","verification":{"payload":"tree d847fc30f5029277053e3e12de42945a881fb9ea\nparent ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0e\nauthor Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1789559178 +0530\ncommitter Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1789559178 +0530\n\nfix e2e guided tour modal race condition on OCP 4.19\n\nguidedTour.close() used two independent if blocks that both matched\nthe modal on OCP 4.19, which has both the guided-tour-modal data-test\nattribute and the pf-v5-c-modal-box class. Since cy commands queued\ninside .then() run after all synchronous checks, both blocks queued a\nclick, the second targeting a button on an already-dismissed modal and\ntiming out after 40s. Changing the second if to else if ensures only\none handler runs per modal.\n\nSuggested by the OCP CI QE Agent analysis on PR #310''s failed e2e run;\nverified there with a passing rerun on OCP 4.19.47.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgeW9W2T/P8IPDBWHl8U6NaDLi5z\n1mW3FTyOIcCewUK4QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL0A5Dyo2iqRpN4ujb9AI8kkAVnY4hNjierG7a0B7pBRUN5WzUtM/+nQHUa0h+Wmh7\n/PQ/WZvfDXsIKLULp8OAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T11:46:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/41e3bd9dbf0e652fb1a6861d2d9bbaf25aff2eb6","node_id":"C_kwDOLVmnatoAKDQxZTNiZDlkYmYwZTY1MmZiMWE2ODYxZDJkOWJiYWYyNWFmZjJlYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0e","sha":"ddfba1241cda017667f29d48874e71bea824fd0