{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/90adaee47f8a6662d826a1e5be3672e0df6e95ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:15:20Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:15:20Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"message":"update test image, test dependencies and Tempo chainsaw fixtures\n\n- tests/Dockerfile-cypress: move to cypress/browsers:24.20.0 (pinned by\n  digest), pin oc 4.22.12 and chainsaw v0.2.15 with sha256 checks, and\n  install Claude Code from its signed apt repository after checking the\n  signing key fingerprint (31DDDE24DDFAB679F42D7BD2BAA929FF1A7ECACE, as\n  published in the Claude Code setup docs)\n- remove the unused integration-tests directory, test-prow-e2e.sh and the\n  related cypress scripts and dependencies from web/package.json\n- tests/package.json: keep only the dependencies the Cypress tests use\n  (drop react, webpack, eslint, etc.), upgrade Cypress to 15.21.1,\n  @cypress/grep to 5.1.0 and mochawesome to 8.0.1; npm audit is clean\n- adapt tests to Cypress 15: cy.exec() yields exitCode instead of code,\n  experimentalStudio was removed, @cypress/grep uses a named register export\n- chainsaw RBAC fixtures: sync with tempo-operator e2e tests: verify RBAC\n  filtering on /api/v2/traces, zstd trace retrieval, collect verify job pod\n  logs on failure, pin test-utils image to sha-0fc5ef0 (also used for MinIO);\n  disable xtrace around curl so ServiceAccount tokens stay out of pod logs\n- set translation_strategy on the collector prometheus exporter: collector\n  0.158 no longer honors add_metric_suffixes: false, so the span metrics\n  checked by check_metrics.sh were exported with _total/_milliseconds suffixes\n- skip the Lightspeed operator install and setup when the Lightspeed test\n  is excluded with CYPRESS_SKIP_TESTS=-Lightspeed; Lightspeed is not\n  published for OCP 4.23/5.0, so the before hook failed there\n- write the Lightspeed chainsaw values file with cy.writeFile (JSON, logging\n  off) instead of printf through cy.exec, so the provider token stays out of\n  the Cypress command log, run videos and screenshots\n- Installation test: wait before checking for the \"Tempo operator isn''t\n  installed yet\" state after each visit; on OCP 5.0 the page renders a few\n  seconds after the visit, so the immediate check never saw it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ujs5pXWWZpPPs9J6QqRVJu","tree":{"sha":"2584de71a5937af7791064b1c053f1daaddcdcad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/trees/2584de71a5937af7791064b1c053f1daaddcdcad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/commits/90adaee47f8a6662d826a1e5be3672e0df6e95ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 2584de71a5937af7791064b1c053f1daaddcdcad\nparent 601ecd80c9fea212ae4d7fee8182e516a0a5f76e\nauthor Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1789139720 +0530\ncommitter Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1789139720 +0530\n\nupdate test image, test dependencies and Tempo chainsaw fixtures\n\n- tests/Dockerfile-cypress: move to cypress/browsers:24.20.0 (pinned by\n  digest), pin oc 4.22.12 and chainsaw v0.2.15 with sha256 checks, and\n  install Claude Code from its signed apt repository after checking the\n  signing key fingerprint (31DDDE24DDFAB679F42D7BD2BAA929FF1A7ECACE, as\n  published in the Claude Code setup docs)\n- remove the unused integration-tests directory, test-prow-e2e.sh and the\n  related cypress scripts and dependencies from web/package.json\n- tests/package.json: keep only the dependencies the Cypress tests use\n  (drop react, webpack, eslint, etc.), upgrade Cypress to 15.21.1,\n  @cypress/grep to 5.1.0 and mochawesome to 8.0.1; npm audit is clean\n- adapt tests to Cypress 15: cy.exec() yields exitCode instead of code,\n  experimentalStudio was removed, @cypress/grep uses a named register export\n- chainsaw RBAC fixtures: sync with tempo-operator e2e tests: verify RBAC\n  filtering on /api/v2/traces, zstd trace retrieval, collect verify job pod\n  logs on failure, pin test-utils image to sha-0fc5ef0 (also used for MinIO);\n  disable xtrace around curl so ServiceAccount tokens stay out of pod logs\n- set translation_strategy on the collector prometheus exporter: collector\n  0.158 no longer honors add_metric_suffixes: false, so the span metrics\n  checked by check_metrics.sh were exported with _total/_milliseconds suffixes\n- skip the Lightspeed operator install and setup when the Lightspeed test\n  is excluded with CYPRESS_SKIP_TESTS=-Lightspeed; Lightspeed is not\n  published for OCP 4.23/5.0, so the before hook failed there\n- write the Lightspeed chainsaw values file with cy.writeFile (JSON, logging\n  off) instead of printf through cy.exec, so the provider token stays out of\n  the Cypress command log, run videos and screenshots\n- Installation test: wait before checking for the \"Tempo operator isn''t\n  installed yet\" state after each visit; on OCP 5.0 the page renders a few\n  seconds after the visit, so the immediate check never saw it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ujs5pXWWZpPPs9J6QqRVJu\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgeW9W2T/P8IPDBWHl8U6NaDLi5z\n1mW3FTyOIcCewUK4QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBVccAoQu8ANHXuvcLnvms9k+tqRW/B1leEfS2OoqKJhPqTHugA2tzsQk4CuA79/k4\nerumeQmFPnXQgY7DmTfAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T15:15:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/90adaee47f8a6662d826a1e5be3672e0df6e95ce","node_id":"C_kwDOLVmnatoAKDkwYWRhZWU0N2Y4YTY2NjJkODI2YTFlNWJlMzY3MmUwZGY2ZTk1Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/601ecd80c9fea212ae4d7fee8182e516a0a5f76e","sha":"601ecd80c9fea212ae4d7fee8182e516a0a5f76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/601ecd80c9fea212ae4d7fee8182e516a0a5f76e"}],"sha":"90adaee47f8a6662d826a