"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/7efcb7d887f1f5d91cc0d8dd2eb4f4bcb9c34600/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T09:43:08Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T09:43:08Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"message":"fix e2e test stability: chainsaw HEREDOC, Span Name filter, TraceLimits reload\n\nThree fixes for flaky/failing e2e tests:\n\n1. Chainsaw Lightspeed values: cy.exec() does not properly pipe HEREDOC\n   stdin to chainsaw --values -, causing the process to hang indefinitely.\n   Write values to a temp file and pass --values <file> instead.\n\n2. Span Name attribute filter: Tempo searchTagValues API returns empty\n   for the intrinsic ''name'' tag, so the dropdown shows ''No results found''\n   with no checkboxes. Use the isCreatable typeahead feature to type a\n   known span name (''GET /dispatch'') directly.\n\n3. TraceLimits page load: after the heavy RBAC test (~280s, many\n   navigations), the plugin component does not render on the next\n   cy.visit() due to stale browser state. Add cy.reload() before\n   visiting and wait for the Tempo instance input with a 30s timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5743d56281898550946a9ee8e1ae4f5faddd870a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/trees/5743d56281898550946a9ee8e1ae4f5faddd870a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/commits/7efcb7d887f1f5d91cc0d8dd2eb4f4bcb9c34600","verification":{"payload":"tree 5743d56281898550946a9ee8e1ae4f5faddd870a\nparent b817ae11e0bd868fb7472e102fed45643c55a7e5\nauthor Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1787218988 +0530\ncommitter Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1787218988 +0530\n\nfix e2e test stability: chainsaw HEREDOC, Span Name filter, TraceLimits reload\n\nThree fixes for flaky/failing e2e tests:\n\n1. Chainsaw Lightspeed values: cy.exec() does not properly pipe HEREDOC\n   stdin to chainsaw --values -, causing the process to hang indefinitely.\n   Write values to a temp file and pass --values <file> instead.\n\n2. Span Name attribute filter: Tempo searchTagValues API returns empty\n   for the intrinsic ''name'' tag, so the dropdown shows ''No results found''\n   with no checkboxes. Use the isCreatable typeahead feature to type a\n   known span name (''GET /dispatch'') directly.\n\n3. TraceLimits page load: after the heavy RBAC test (~280s, many\n   navigations), the plugin component does not render on the next\n   cy.visit() due to stale browser state. Add cy.reload() before\n   visiting and wait for the Tempo instance input with a 30s timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgeW9W2T/P8IPDBWHl8U6NaDLi5z\n1mW3FTyOIcCewUK4QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHSxJtld2NiYrWW6OHjWUJKGX/+QgKQJXf6I5Q+hSijdo5Q7vmODBEG8gccpi+0fml\nyFS0q5cT6VQsqa83OLvAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T09:43:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h