ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/16b88f3da2fea86128fb5275e36996aa616f69a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T05:39:36Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T05:39:36Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"message":"TRACING-6170: Add e2e tests for Perses 0.54.0-beta.1 features and update docs\n\nAdd three new Cypress e2e tests covering features introduced via the\nbump-perses-0.54.0 dependency update:\n\n- [Capability:GanttSearch] — Gantt chart span search (perses/plugins#661):\n  toggle search bar, service-name query, match counter (X/Y), Next/Prev\n  navigation, 0/0 for no results, disabled buttons, clear, hide toggle.\n\n- [Capability:AttributePaneResize] — Attribute pane resizing (perses/plugins#636):\n  drag ResizableDivider (previousElementSibling of [style*=\"min-width\"])\n  to 40% of chart width and assert pane width strictly increases.\n  Validates the getComputedStyle()-based spacing fix for MUI CSS vars.\n\n- [Capability:TraceTableColumns] — Trace table word wrap (perses/plugins#655):\n  Spans column header/cell text, Box flexWrap wrapper existence, Start time\n  column header/cell. Uses .MuiDataGrid-cell[data-field=\"...\"] to exclude\n  column headers from data cell assertions.\n\nAlso fixes:\n- before() hook (SKIP_COO_INSTALL=true): replace UIPlugin delete+recreate\n  with idempotent oc apply to avoid __load_plugin_entry__ is not defined\n  errors caused by browser-cached stale plugin URLs after UIPlugin deletion.\n- TraceLimits flake: add cy.wait(500) between menuToggleContains click and\n  pfSelectMenuItem to allow PatternFly menu animation to complete.\n- TraceTableColumns selector: scope to .MuiDataGrid-cell[data-field=\"...\"]\n  instead of [data-field=\"...\"] alone to exclude column headers.\n- verifyTracesVisible: replace static $body.find() snapshot with\n  Cypress.Promise polling (500ms interval) for live DOM detection.\n\nUpdate all .md files and TEST_COVERAGE_REPORT.md to reflect 15 tests,\nnew selector patterns, OCP 4.22+ requirement, and UIPlugin lifecycle fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"354ed394d9fd27d9c7986e9c3ae2c2b73ea8bcfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/trees/354ed394d9fd27d9c7986e9c3ae2c2b73ea8bcfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/commits/16b88f3da2fea86128fb5275e36996aa616f69a0","verification":{"payload":"tree 354ed394d9fd27d9c7986e9c3ae2c2b73ea8bcfe\nparent a202cbe73917b779694a29eae1130b22b43f9d07\nauthor Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1780033176 +0530\ncommitter Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1780033176 +0530\n\nTRACING-6170: Add e2e tests for Perses 0.54.0-beta.1 features and update docs\n\nAdd three new Cypress e2e tests covering features introduced via the\nbump-perses-0.54.0 dependency update:\n\n- [Capability:GanttSearch] — Gantt chart span search (perses/plugins#661):\n  toggle search bar, service-name query, match counter (X/Y), Next/Prev\n  navigation, 0/0 for no results, disabled buttons, clear, hide toggle.\n\n- [Capability:AttributePaneResize] — Attribute pane resizing (perses/plugins#636):\n  drag ResizableDivider (previousElementSibling of [style*=\"min-width\"])\n  to 40% of chart width and assert pane width strictly increases.\n  Validates the getComputedStyle()-based spacing fix for MUI CSS vars.\n\n- [Capability:TraceTableColumns] — Trace table word wrap (perses/plugins#655):\n  Spans column header/cell text, Box flexWrap wrapper existence, Start time\n  column header/cell. Uses .MuiDataGrid-cell[data-field=\"...\"] to exclude\n  column headers from data cell assertions.\n\nAlso fixes:\n- before() hook (SKIP_COO_INSTALL=true): replace UIPlugin delete+recreate\n  with idempotent oc apply to avoid __load_plugin_entry__ is not defined\n  errors caused by browser-cached stale plugin URLs after UIPlugin deletion.\n- TraceLimits flake: add cy.wait(500) between menuToggleContains click and\n  pfSelectMenuItem to allow PatternFly menu animation to complete.\n- TraceTableColumns selector: scope to .MuiDataGrid-cell[data-field=\"...\"]\n  instead of [data-field=\"...\"] alone to exclude column headers.\n- verifyTracesVisible: replace static $body.find() snapshot with\n  Cypress.Promise polling (500ms interval) for live DOM detection.\n\nUpdate all .md files and TEST_COVERAGE_REPORT.md to reflect 15 tests,\nnew selector patterns, OCP 4.22+ requirement, and UIPlugin lifecycle fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgeW9W2T/P8IPDBWHl8U6NaDLi5z\n1mW3FTyOIcCewUK4QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEDHKZJ+cKVfS7GIsV6rlr+VRsnUaRk1HsOTVkMdu2NzTUKY/Ni6Qhc8K65ZmGXPcw\nkD8UHlTT7P4LZ50HruuQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T05:39:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: