ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commits/449502b8f79d0f2e4b6caad828c1cd7049df730e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T08:05:33Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T08:05:33Z","email":"ikanse@redhat.com","name":"Ishwar Kanse"},"message":"test: patch CLI args instead of env vars in TLS profile tests\n\nCOO reads the cluster TLS profile from apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster\nand passes it to the plugin as CLI args (e.g. -tls-min-version=VersionTLS12).\nCLI args take priority over env vars in mergeEnvValue, so the tests must patch\nthe deployment CLI args directly to accurately simulate what COO does.\n\nReplace patch_tls_env/remove_tls_env (env var patching) with\npatch_tls_args/remove_tls_args (CLI arg patching) throughout the TLS profile\nchainsaw test suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9c81cfa32046d1162d3ac6953eddeab720ddb41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/trees/c9c81cfa32046d1162d3ac6953eddeab720ddb41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/git/commits/449502b8f79d0f2e4b6caad828c1cd7049df730e","verification":{"payload":"tree c9c81cfa32046d1162d3ac6953eddeab720ddb41\nparent 947d18d323719fdb139ac8f0402cefc493042120\nauthor Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1779350733 +0530\ncommitter Ishwar Kanse <ikanse@redhat.com> 1779350733 +0530\n\ntest: patch CLI args instead of env vars in TLS profile tests\n\nCOO reads the cluster TLS profile from apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster\nand passes it to the plugin as CLI args (e.g. -tls-min-version=VersionTLS12).\nCLI args take priority over env vars in mergeEnvValue, so the tests must patch\nthe deployment CLI args directly to accurately simulate what COO does.\n\nReplace patch_tls_env/remove_tls_env (env var patching) with\npatch_tls_args/remove_tls_args (CLI arg patching) throughout the TLS profile\nchainsaw test suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgeW9W2T/P8IPDBWHl8U6NaDLi5z\n1mW3FTyOIcCewUK4QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPcflZ+/Zv3LfU7tInn9uV/bL24GO1ZDvRGr+R6EYvGoy15zIDxot3SLh8iy+CwuW9\n/DHovmuLhlUA/j4y4J3AQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T08:05:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10349173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IshwarKanse","id":10349173,"login":"IshwarKanse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ5MTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IshwarKanse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openshift/distributed-tracing-console-plugin/commit/